{"id":"n79353-1-11","stage":2,"title":"청혼 · 求婚","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79353-1-11-1","ko":"내 청혼을 받아 주겠어요?","zh":"你愿意接受我的求婚吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"청혼을","meaning":"求婚","explanation":"청혼：求婚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"청혼","audio":"/audio/39ab21590769904c6dbc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79353","senseId":"1","lemma":"청혼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받아","meaning":"接，接受","explanation":"받다：接，接受；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"9","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주겠어요?","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"39ab21590769904c","term":"청혼","zh":"求婚","audio":"/audio/39ab21590769904c6dbc.mp3","entryId":"79353","definition":"请求对方跟自己结婚。","pronunciation":["청혼"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接，接受","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到要求、申请、提问、攻击或信号等的作用，或指对这些做出反应。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4693bf055026c740d58f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n79353-1-11-2","ko":"물론이지, 당신에게 멋진 남편이 될게.","zh":"当然愿意，我会成为对你来说最棒的丈夫的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물론이지,","meaning":"当然，不用说","explanation":"물론：当然，不用说；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"물론","audio":"/audio/86ee58f45cccde9947f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89812","senseId":"1","lemma":"물론","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"당신에게","meaning":"您，你","explanation":"당신：您，你；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"당신","audio":"/audio/348eb0b3d01dfc542003.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30200","senseId":"2","lemma":"당신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"멋진","meaning":"帅气，潇洒，优秀","explanation":"멋지다：帅气，潇洒，优秀；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"멋지다","audio":"/audio/2b6551da3926436a9395.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15991","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남편이","meaning":"丈夫，老公","explanation":"남편：丈夫，老公；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"남편","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31919","senseId":"1","lemma":"남편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될게.","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86ee58f45cccde99","term":"물론","zh":"当然，不用说","audio":"/audio/86ee58f45cccde9947f0.mp3","entryId":"89812","definition":"没有必要说的。","pronunciation":["물론"]},{"id":"348eb0b3d01dfc54","term":"당신","zh":"您，你","audio":"/audio/348eb0b3d01dfc542003.mp3","entryId":"30200","definition":"(敬语)夫妻之间一方对另一方的称呼。","pronunciation":["당신"]},{"id":"2b6551da3926436a","term":"멋지다","zh":"帅气，潇洒，优秀","audio":"/audio/2b6551da3926436a9395.mp3","entryId":"15991","definition":"很好或很美。","pronunciation":["먿찌다"]},{"id":"a4e8e584126026d6","term":"남편","zh":"丈夫，老公","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3","entryId":"31919","definition":"夫妻关系中的男人。","pronunciation":["남편"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fd07e16c7bb19feae0d5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.633,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=79353","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":81,"sequenceScore":2.2306,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你愿意接受我的求婚吗？","当然愿意，我会成为对你来说最棒的丈夫的。","今天你说没做作业就去学校了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你愿意接受我的求婚吗？","当然愿意，我会成为对你来说最棒的丈夫的。","今天你说没做作业就去学校了？"],"answer":1}]}
